'''Klefki''' (Japanese: '''クレッフィ''' ''Cleffy'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

