===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Klefki|110}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Hook''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon|Magnemite|61}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

